  "project_description": "With just a couple clicks you can change your boring Drupal search box into a nice looking search box with icon animations.\n\n Additional features: \n\n \n Configurable search box size \n Configurable placeholder text \n \n The module currently has four search box theme to select from:\n\n \n Background Fade \n Expand Search Box on Hover \n Expand Icon on Hover \n Slide Icon into View on Hover \n \n \n\n The configuration is located at: admin/config/search/better-search\n\n \n\n \nThis module is created by: 3C Web Services \n Follow us on Twitter: @3CWebDev",
